  gggggdsssssSssss
  gggggdsSSSSSSSSS
  gggggdsSEEEEEEEE
  gggggdsSE...f...
  gggggdsSE.......
  ggGggdsSE.......
  gGgGgdsSE.......
  gggggdsSE.......
  gggggdsSE.......
  gggggdsSE.......

derive coin_NE = fliph coin_NO
derive coin_SO = flipv coin_NO
derive coin_SE = rot180 coin_NO
